# SafeBite-Frontend - Root Git Ignore

# ─── Reference Repositories ──────────────────────────────────────────
# SafeBite-Backend is cloned as a separate read-only repository.
# Do not track its files or submodule in the frontend repository.
SafeBite-Backend/
Safebite-Backend/

# ─── Environment & Secrets (NEVER COMMIT) ────────────────────────────
.env
.env*.local
*.env
*.env.local
!*.env.example

# ─── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ─── Expo & Build Outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────
.expo/
**/.expo/
dist/
**/dist/
web-build/
**/web-build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Native & Generated Outputs ──────────────────────────────────────
ios/
android/
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# ─── Logs & Debugging ────────────────────────────────────────────────
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
*.log

# ─── OS & IDE Metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
